            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impor library yang benar untuk mengaktifkan penggunaan <code>getenv</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.getenv(\" /><text value=\"&quot;MY_API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"9\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>os</code>.</p></body></html>"
